## Docs — the decision log ships, working notes stay local.
##
## DECISIONS.md is the argument this project exists to make, so excluding it
## published the conclusion and withheld the reasoning. Status audits are
## point-in-time working notes with no value to a reader, and CLAUDE.md carries
## machine-specific detail; both stay local. Delete the CLAUDE.md line to
## publish it.
